            "1756978566601a002564": {
              "type": "$rich-text",
              "settings": {
                "content": "\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eWe believe every child is a natural explorer. From muddy soccer fields to sunny park runs, our children's sportswear is inspired by these joyful moments of play. Launched in 2024, Mudjean was born from a simple mission: to make sports fun for kids, not a burden.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eOur mission: Make sports fun, not a burden. Through sustainable materials and innovative designs, we help parents choose reliable companions for their children. Whether it's a family soccer game or daily activities, Mudjean accompanies every step of growth—because joy starts from the mud!\u003c/p\u003e"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
